{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54264","headline":"垂训诗 · 令超","name":"垂训诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行藏虚实自家知，祸福因由更问谁。\n善恶到头终有报，只争来早与来迟。\n闲中检点平生事，静坐思量日所爲。\n常把一心行正道，自然天地不相亏。\n（见《悦心集》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令超","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}